msgid "common/boxCategory/lowerCase/dragonboat"
msgstr "Dragon Boat Boxes"

msgid "common/boxCategory/upperCase/dragonboat"
msgstr "DRAGON BOAT BOXES"

msgid "entryPoint/tooltip/description"
msgstr ""
"These are special boxes containing unique and valuable in-game items.\n"
"You can obtain boxes in the in-game Store or Premium Shop."

msgid "entryPoint/tooltip/title"
msgstr "Dragon Boat Boxes and How to Receive Them"

msgid "entryPoint/tooltip/warningTitle"
msgstr "Dragon Boat Boxes Temporarily Unavailable"

msgid "eventName/lowerCase"
msgstr "Tame the Dragon, Ride the Wind"

msgid "eventName/upperCase"
msgstr "TAME THE DRAGON, RIDE THE WIND"

msgid "infoPage/footer/description/compensation"
msgstr ""
"If you already own all vehicles from the list of possible box contents, then"
" all subsequent vehicles you receive from Dragon Boat Boxes will be "
"compensated in gold equal to their full value."

msgid "infoPage/footer/description/guaranteed"
msgstr ""
"Every %(guaranteed0)s Dragon Boat Boxes are guaranteed to contain a Tier "
"VIII–IX vehicle. If you open them without one dropping such a vehicle, then "
"a Tier VIII–IX vehicle you do not already own will drop when you open the "
"%(guaranteed0)sth Dragon Boat Box. When it does, the counter is reset."

msgid "noBoxesView/description/"
msgstr ""
"You do not have any boxes.\n"
"You can get them in the in-game Store."

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/lootBoxesAutoOpen/count"
msgstr "Boxes opened: %(boxes)s"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/lootBoxesAutoOpen/header"
msgstr "Remaining Boxes Opened"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/lootBoxesAutoOpen/text"
msgstr ""
"At the end of the event, we opened all of your boxes and added their "
"contents to your account."
